<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Tom Brown Inc with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tom Brown was up 1/8 to 21-3/8.</p>
